Day 59 - Route Table Investigation
Objective
Understand how Route Tables affect internet connectivity.

Investigation
Verified Public IP address
Verified Security Group rules
Reviewed Route Table configuration
Checked Internet Gateway connectivity
Root Cause
The Route Table was missing or had an incorrect route to the Internet Gateway.

Resolution
Configured the correct route:

0.0.0.0/0 → Internet Gateway

Key Takeaway
Internet access requires:

Public IP
Security Group
Route Table
Internet Gateway
